        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Tourist opens a public tour's details and chooses &quot;Report&quot;." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system checks whether the Tourist has already reported this tour and shows a form with the reasons: False information, Offensive, Spam, Copyright violation, Other. A1." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-110" y="225" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Tourist picks a reason, enters a note (required for &quot;Other&quot;, up to 500 characters) and taps &quot;Send report&quot;. E1, E2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="405" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system (Tour) checks that the tour is public, the Tourist is not the author and has never reported this tour. E3, E4, E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="145" width="320" x="-160" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The system saves the report and increases the tour's open report count; when 5 different accounts reach it within 7 days, the tour is flagged for the Admin." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-110" y="815" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. The system publishes the tour.reported event (without the reporter's identity); Notification creates an in-app notification for the author (no email). E6." vertex="1">
