        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. The Tourist is the author → the client hides the &quot;Report&quot; button; calling the API directly → 403 &quot;You cannot report your own tour&quot;." vertex="1">
